  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pilot plant testing on drinking water from rain with innovative pesticides removal technology for the Mekong Delta Vietnam (Nuoc Mua)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This pilot project will install and test innivative technology for innovative water purification and rainwater filtering technology, on four pilot locations in the Can Tho Province, Vietnam. The project is implemented by Wageningen University with Water Innovation Consulting (WIC), P.B. International, Can Tho University, and Stepsvn Installation Company. The technology focuses on removing waterbourne diseases and pesticides in an efficient and cost-effective way, thereby positively contributing to water security.</narrative>
  </description>
